# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env and fill in.  .env is git-ignored; this file is not, so that the
# required keys are documented without the secret ever entering the history.
#
# The token is requested from transparency@entsoe.eu ("RESTful API access") and,
# once access is granted, generated under My Account Settings on the platform.
# Access being approved is not the same as the token existing — it is a separate
# button.  entsoe-py reads this exact variable name on its own, so it is not
# renamed here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

ENTSOE_API_KEY=
